+Move keeps the task's ID, title, status and assignee. It requires the `manager`
+role in the source project and write access (`contributor` or `manager`, not
+archived) in the destination; an unreadable destination is 404. The assignee
+must be a contributor or manager of the destination (else 400), and a
+contributor in the destination may only receive tasks assigned to themselves or
+to nobody (403).
 
